                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Olney to Mr. McDonald.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-05-01"><hi rendition="#italic">May 1,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>President directs appropriate expression of abhorrence and sincere condolence in
                    name of American people.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Olney.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
